</details></div></div></header><main id=\"main\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/case-studies/saas-cloud-identity-review#article\",\"headline\":\"Three weeks of identity-graph analysis found a four-step path from any repository contributor to the customer database.\",\"description\":\"A SOC 2 Type II commitment to a large customer, a CSPM tool producing 1,840 findings, and an engineering team of nineteen with no security specialist. The findings list had been triaged twice and abandoned twice, because a list ranked by vendor severity and filtered by nothing gives a team no way to\",\"articleSection\":\"Case study\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/case-studies/saas-cloud-identity-review\"},\"about\":{\"@type\":\"Thing\",\"name\":\"SaaS & Technology\"},\"keywords\":\"Cloud Security, Platform & DevOps, GRC & Compliance\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":true,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/#organization\"},\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/#organization\"},\"citation\":[\"4 steps — from repository contributor to customer data (Closed in 11 days)\",\"1,840 → 210 — CSPM findings after reachability filtering (Same estate, same day)\",\"11 days → 40 min — median lead time for change (After the platform work, measured over 14 months)\"]},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/case-studies/saas-cloud-identity-review#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Case studies\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com/case-studies\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Three weeks of identity-graph analysis found a four-step path from any repository contributor to the customer database.\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com/case-studies/saas-cloud-identity-review\"}]}]}</script><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" style=\"padding-top:calc(var(--nav-h) + var(--s16))\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-headline\"><div class=\"u-container\"><nav class=\"cs-breadcrumb u-mono\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol><li><a href=\"/\">Envenox</a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies\">Case studies</a></li><li aria-current=\"page\">SaaS &amp; Technology</li></ol></nav><div class=\"cs-meta\"><div class=\"cs-meta__cell\"><span class=\"cs-meta__key u-mono\">Client</span><p class=\"cs-meta__value\">B2B SaaS platform, 140 employees</p></div><div class=\"cs-meta__cell\"><span class=\"cs-meta__key u-mono\">Industry</span><p class=\"cs-meta__value\">SaaS &amp; Technology<!-- --> · <!-- -->Germany</p></div><div class=\"cs-meta__cell\"><span class=\"cs-meta__key u-mono\">Services used</span><ul class=\"cs-meta__tags\"><li><a class=\"cs-meta__tag-link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\"><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Cloud Security</span></a></li><li><a class=\"cs-meta__tag-link\" href=\"/services/platform-engineering\"><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Platform &amp; DevOps</span></a></li><li><a class=\"cs-meta__tag-link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\"><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">GRC &amp; Compliance</span></a></li></ul></div><div class=\"cs-meta__cell\"><span class=\"cs-meta__key u-mono\">Engagement</span><p class=\"cs-meta__value\">3 weeks review, 14 weeks remediation<!-- --> · <!-- -->Project</p></div></div><div class=\"cs-hero\"><div class=\"cs-hero__main\"><div class=\"cs-meta__markers\"><div class=\"cs-meta__nda\"><div class=\"nda\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3333333333333335\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock nda__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg><div class=\"nda__body\"><span class=\"nda__kicker u-mono\">Named under NDA</span><p class=\"nda__name\">B2B SaaS platform, 140 employees</p><p class=\"nda__note\">Metrics, technical detail and the attributed quote are published with written client approval. The name is not.</p></div></div></div><a class=\"dual\" href=\"/services/devsecops\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers dual__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg><span>Both pillars — security and software</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div><h1 id=\"cs-headline\" class=\"cs-headline\">Three weeks of identity-graph analysis found a four-step path from any repository contributor to the customer database.</h1></div><div class=\"cs-hero__results\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow cs-results__key\">Results</p><ul class=\"mc mc--stack\" aria-label=\"The three measured results, each drawn from its own figures\"><li class=\"mc-row\"><p class=\"mc-value u-tnum\">4 steps</p><p class=\"mc-label\">from repository contributor to customer data</p><div class=\"mc-art\"><p class=\"mc-nochart\">One measured count, with nothing to measure it against — so it is set, not drawn.</p></div><p class=\"mc-note u-mono\"><span class=\"mc-noteKey\">Measurement window</span>Closed in 11 days</p></li><li class=\"mc-row\"><p class=\"mc-value u-tnum\">1,840 → 210</p><p class=\"mc-label\">CSPM findings after reachability filtering</p><div class=\"mc-art\"><svg class=\"mc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 56\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"CSPM findings after reachability filtering: 1,840 before, 210 after, 89% lower. Both bars are drawn to one scale.\"><rect class=\"mc-barFrom\" x=\"0\" y=\"6\" width=\"300\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"mc-barText mc-barText--on\" x=\"294\" y=\"17\" text-anchor=\"end\">1,840</text><rect class=\"mc-barTo\" x=\"0\" y=\"33\" width=\"34.23913043478261\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"mc-barText mc-barText--to\" x=\"41.23913043478261\" y=\"44\">210</text></svg></div><p class=\"mc-note u-mono\"><span class=\"mc-noteKey\">Measurement window</span>Same estate, same day</p></li><li class=\"mc-row\"><p class=\"mc-value u-tnum\">11 days → 40 min</p><p class=\"mc-label\">median lead time for change</p><div class=\"mc-art\"><svg class=\"mc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 56\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"median lead time for change: 11 days before, 40 min after, 99.7% lower. Both bars are drawn to one scale.\"><rect class=\"mc-barFrom\" x=\"0\" y=\"6\" width=\"300\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"mc-barText mc-barText--on\" x=\"294\" y=\"17\" text-anchor=\"end\">11 days</text><rect class=\"mc-barTo\" x=\"0\" y=\"33\" width=\"3\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"mc-barText mc-barText--to\" x=\"10\" y=\"44\">40 min</text></svg></div><p class=\"mc-note u-mono\"><span class=\"mc-noteKey\">Measurement window</span>After the platform work, measured over 14 months</p></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-challenge\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"cs-band\"><div class=\"cs-band__head\"><h2 id=\"cs-challenge\" class=\"cs-band__title\">The challenge</h2></div><div class=\"prose u-measure\"><p>A SOC 2 Type II commitment to a large customer, a CSPM tool producing 1,840 findings, and an engineering team of nineteen with no security specialist. The findings list had been triaged twice and abandoned twice, because a list ranked by vendor severity and filtered by nothing gives a team no way to decide what to do on Monday. Separately, deploying to production depended on one engineer and a laptop.</p></div></div><div class=\"cs-band\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s24)\"><div class=\"cs-band__head\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">In <!-- -->6<!-- --> phases</p><h2 id=\"cs-approach\" class=\"cs-band__title\">The approach</h2></div><ol class=\"reveal-group cs-phases\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-approach\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"cs-phase\"><p class=\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\">01</p><div><h3 class=\"cs-phase__name\">Build the identity graph</h3><p class=\"cs-phase__body\">Every human user, service principal, CI role, instance profile, cross-account trust and OIDC federation, read from the actual policy documents rather than the console summary. Enumeration took hours; the analysis took three weeks.</p></div></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"cs-phase\"><p class=\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\">02</p><div><h3 class=\"cs-phase__name\">Filter the findings by reachability</h3><p class=\"cs-phase__body\">We ingested the CSPM output and filtered to what is exploitable in this topology. 1,840 became 210, and 210 is a list a team of nineteen can act on.</p></div></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"cs-phase\"><p class=\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\">03</p><div><h3 class=\"cs-phase__name\">Fix the paths, as pull requests</h3><p class=\"cs-phase__body\">Terraform for every recommended change, raised against their infrastructure repository and reviewed by their engineers like any other change. A diff beats a recommendation.</p></div></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"cs-phase\"><p class=\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\">04</p><div><h3 class=\"cs-phase__name\">Move the pipeline identity</h3><p class=\"cs-phase__body\">Long-lived access keys in CI replaced with short-lived OIDC federation scoped per environment. This was the root of the four-step path and it is the most common cloud finding we report.</p></div></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"cs-phase\"><p class=\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\">05</p><div><h3 class=\"cs-phase__name\">Make deployment boring</h3><p class=\"cs-phase__body\">Build-once-promote pipeline, preview environments per pull request, automated rollback on signal. The dependency on one engineer and one laptop was removed in week six.</p></div></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"cs-phase\"><p class=\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\">06</p><div><h3 class=\"cs-phase__name\">Re-run the graph</h3><p class=\"cs-phase__body\">After remediation, to confirm the paths were closed rather than relocated — which is a real failure mode when fixes are applied individually.</p></div></div></li></ol></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-label=\"What B2B SaaS platform said\"><div class=\"u-container\"><figure class=\"cs-quote\" style=\"margin:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.125\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote cs-quote__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><div><blockquote class=\"cs-quote__text\">We had 1,840 findings and no way to start. The useful output was not the report, it was the 210 and the reason the other 1,630 did not matter in our setup. Our engineers merged the Terraform the same week.</blockquote><figcaption class=\"cs-quote__attr\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for VP Engineering\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;font-size:19px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(249 18% 22%), hsl(249 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">VE</span></div><div><p class=\"cs-quote__name\">VP Engineering</p><p class=\"cs-quote__role\">VP Engineering<!-- --> · <!-- -->B2B SaaS platform</p></div></figcaption></div></figure></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-technical\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"cs-band\"><div class=\"cs-band__head\"><h2 id=\"cs-technical\" class=\"cs-band__title\">The technical layer</h2><p class=\"cs-band__hint\">What we actually found or built.</p></div><div class=\"prose u-measure\"><p>The path: any contributor could open a pull request; the pull-request workflow ran with the same long-lived AWS access key as the deploy workflow, because both used the repository-level secret; that key’s role could assume the production deployment role via a trust policy with no external ID and no condition on the source workflow; the deployment role carried `kms:Decrypt` on the key protecting the customer database snapshot bucket, because a restore script had needed it once in 2023 and the permission had never been removed. Four steps, no exploit, no vulnerability in any software — four configuration decisions each of which was locally reasonable. No CSPM tool ranked any of them above medium, because individually none of them is above medium. The fix was OIDC federation with a condition on both the repository and the branch, a scoped deployment role per environment, and the removal of the 2023 permission.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-timeline\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"cs-band\"><div class=\"cs-band__head\"><h2 id=\"cs-timeline\" class=\"cs-band__title\">The engagement in time</h2><p class=\"cs-band__hint\">3 weeks review, 14 weeks remediation · Project</p></div><figure class=\"eb\"><svg class=\"eb-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 146\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Engagement timeline for this study, 48 weeks end to end. Identity graph, 3 weeks. remediation, 14 weeks. verification at 17 weeks. SOC 2 Type II achieved at 48 weeks.\"><g><rect class=\"eb-seg\" x=\"0\" y=\"74\" width=\"62.76807197405587\" height=\"26\"></rect></g><g><rect class=\"eb-seg eb-seg--alt\" x=\"62.76807197405587\" y=\"74\" width=\"292.91766921226076\" height=\"26\"></rect><text class=\"eb-segLabel\" x=\"70.76807197405587\" y=\"91\">remediation</text></g><g><line class=\"eb-markLine\" x1=\"355.6857411863166\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"355.6857411863166\" y2=\"100\"></line><circle class=\"eb-markDot\" cx=\"355.6857411863166\" cy=\"100\" r=\"3.5\"></circle><text class=\"eb-markLabel\" x=\"361.6857411863166\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"start\">verification</text></g><g><line class=\"eb-markLine\" x1=\"999\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"999\" y2=\"100\"></line><circle class=\"eb-markDot\" cx=\"999\" cy=\"100\" r=\"3.5\"></circle><text class=\"eb-markLabel\" x=\"993\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"end\">SOC 2 Type II achieved</text></g><line class=\"eb-axis\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"1000\" y2=\"112\"></line><text class=\"eb-axisLabel\" x=\"0\" y=\"128\">week 0</text><text class=\"eb-axisLabel\" x=\"1000\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"end\">week 48</text></svg><ol class=\"eb-list\"><li class=\"eb-item\" data-kind=\"span\"><span class=\"eb-itemName\">Identity graph</span><span class=\"eb-itemWhen u-mono\">3 weeks</span></li><li class=\"eb-item\" data-kind=\"span\"><span class=\"eb-itemName\">remediation</span><span class=\"eb-itemWhen u-mono\">14 weeks</span></li><li class=\"eb-item\" data-kind=\"mark\"><span class=\"eb-itemName\">verification</span><span class=\"eb-itemWhen u-mono\">week 17</span></li><li class=\"eb-item\" data-kind=\"mark\"><span class=\"eb-itemName\">SOC 2 Type II achieved</span><span class=\"eb-itemWhen u-mono\">month 11</span></li></ol><figcaption class=\"eb-cap\">Segment length is this engagement’s own stated duration, converted to weeks and drawn to one scale. A stage stated as a date rather than a length — “month 11” — is drawn as a milestone on the same axis instead of being given a width it never had, and a stage with no stated end is listed below rather than drawn, because an open commitment has no length to draw.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-engagement\"><div class=\"u-container\"><h2 id=\"cs-engagement\" class=\"u-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s8)\">The engagement</h2><ul class=\"cs-facts\"><li class=\"cs-fact\"><h3 class=\"cs-fact__key u-eyebrow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg>Tech and tools</h3><ul class=\"cs-fact__chips\" aria-label=\"Stack and tooling\"><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">AWS</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Terraform</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">GitHub Actions</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Kubernetes</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">ArgoCD</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">PostgreSQL</span></li></ul></li><li class=\"cs-fact\"><h3 class=\"cs-fact__key u-eyebrow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>Team shape</h3><p class=\"cs-fact__body\">A cloud security lead, a platform engineer, and a GRC lead for the SOC 2 mapping.</p></li><li class=\"cs-fact\"><h3 class=\"cs-fact__key u-eyebrow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg>Length and shape</h3><p class=\"cs-fact__body\">3 weeks review, 14 weeks remediation · Project · 6 phases</p></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-related\"><div class=\"u-container\"><h2 id=\"cs-related\" style=\"font-size:var(--text-2xl);margin-bottom:var(--s8)\">Related case studies</h2><ul class=\"reveal-group cs-related\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg cs-card\"><div class=\"cs-card__top\"><p class=\"cs-card__client\">Freight and customs broker, 1,200 employees</p><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--brand\">Under NDA</span></div><h3 class=\"cs-card__headline\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/case-studies/logistics-mdr-rollout\">Onboarding found that 31% of configured log sources had never delivered an event — before a single detection was written.</a></h3><p class=\"cs-card__meta\"><span>Logistics</span><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3.230769230769231\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Netherlands</span><span>Retainer</span></p><ul class=\"cs-card__tags\" aria-label=\"Services used on Freight and customs broker, 1,200 employees\"><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">MDR</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Cloud Security</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Incident Response</span></li></ul><div class=\"cs-card__metric\"><p class=\"cs-card__metric-value u-tnum\">31%</p><p class=\"cs-card__metric-label\">of configured log sources were silently not arriving</p></div></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg cs-card\"><div class=\"cs-card__top\"><p class=\"cs-card__client\">Enterprise payments provider, 900 employees</p><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--brand\">Under NDA</span></div><h3 class=\"cs-card__headline\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/case-studies/fintech-payment-platform\">A payment platform handling £4.1bn a year went from 23 repeat finding classes a year to four.</a></h3><p class=\"cs-card__meta\"><span>Financial Services</span><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3.230769230769231\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>United Kingdom</span><span>Retainer</span></p><ul class=\"cs-card__tags\" aria-label=\"Services used on Enterprise payments provider, 900 employees\"><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Penetration Testing</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">AppSec</span></li></ul><div class=\"cs-card__metric\"><p class=\"cs-card__metric-value u-tnum\">35 → 9</p><p class=\"cs-card__metric-label\">confirmed findings between first and fourth test</p></div></div></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/case-studies\">All case studies</a> · <a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Walk a sample report</a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-cta\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"humans\"><div><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Get started</p><h2 id=\"cs-cta\" style=\"font-size:var(--text-3xl);margin:var(--s3) 0 0\">Book a 60-minute scoping call</h2><p style=\"color:var(--muted-strong);max-width:52ch;margin-top:var(--s4)\">A technical conversation with the person who would lead the work — not a qualification script, not a discovery deck. You come away with a written scope, the exclusions stated in the body rather than in an appendix, and a day count that we have not padded.</p><div class=\"humans__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\" href=\"/sample-report\"><span>Walk the report</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--ghost btn--lg\" href=\"/customers\"><span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--s2)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Who we work with</span></span></a></div><p class=\"humans__sla\">A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.</p></div><ul class=\"humans__people\" aria-label=\"Who replies to a new enquiry\"><li class=\"human\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for Claire Benoit\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;font-size:16px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(153 18% 22%), hsl(153 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">CB</span></div><div><p class=\"human__name\">Claire Benoit</p><p class=\"human__role\">Practice Director, Governance &amp; Risk</p></div></li><li class=\"human\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for Marcus Reid\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;font-size:16px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(319 18% 22%), hsl(319 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">MR</span></div><div><p class=\"human__name\">Marcus Reid</p><p class=\"human__role\">Head of Engineering</p></div></li><li class=\"human\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for Amara Nwosu\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;font-size:16px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(334 18% 22%), hsl(334 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">AN</span></div><div><p class=\"human__name\">Amara Nwosu</p><p class=\"human__role\">Chief Operating Officer</p></div></li></ul></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"foot theme-dark transition-theme grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"foot__top\"><div class=\"foot__brand\"><a class=\"foot__wordmark\" href=\"/\">Envenox</a><p class=\"foot__positioning\">Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.</p><a class=\"foot__hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\" data-ir-hotline=\"footer\"><span class=\"foot__hotline-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span class=\"u-eyebrow\">Incident response — 24/7</span></span><span class=\"foot__hotline-number\">+44 20 4525 9100</span><span class=\"foot__hotline-note\">Answered by a responder, 24/7. Median pickup under 4 minutes.</span></a></div><nav class=\"foot__cols\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Cybersecurity</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\">Cloud Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/red-teaming\">Red Teaming</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/incident-response\">Incident Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/vciso\">vCISO</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Software Development</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/web-application-development\">Web Applications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/erp\">ERP</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/crm\">CRM</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/hrm\">HRM</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/lms\">LMS</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/qa-automation\">QA &amp; Test Automation</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Company</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/about/leadership\">Leadership</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/approach\">The Adversary Loop</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/newsroom\">Newsroom</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/locations\">Locations</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/partners\">Partners</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Proof &amp; Resources</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/case-studies\">Case Studies</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Sample Report</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/customers\">Customers</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/certifications\">Certifications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/trust\">Trust Centre</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/blog\">Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Labs</a></li></ul></div></nav></div><div class=\"foot__mid\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Offices</h2><div class=\"foot__offices\"><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>London<!-- -->, <!-- -->United Kingdom</p><address class=\"foot__office-line\">1 Fore Street Avenue, London EC2Y 9DT</address></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Dhaka<!-- -->, <!-- -->Bangladesh</p><address class=\"foot__office-line\">Level 7, Bay’s Galleria, Gulshan 1, Dhaka 1212</address></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>General enquiries</p><p class=\"foot__office-line\"><a class=\"foot__link u-link\" href=\"mailto:hello@envenox.com\">hello@envenox.com</a></p></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>Security reports</p><p class=\"foot__office-line\"><a class=\"foot__link u-link\" href=\"mailto:security@envenox.com\">security@envenox.com</a></p></div></div></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Research notes</h2><form class=\"foot__form\" action=\"/api/newsletter\" method=\"post\"><label class=\"foot__form-label\" for=\"footer-newsletter-email\">Email address</label><div class=\"foot__form-row\"><input class=\"foot__input\" id=\"footer-newsletter-email\" type=\"email\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footer-newsletter-hint\" name=\"email\"/><button class=\"foot__submit\" type=\"submit\">Subscribe</button></div><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source\" value=\"footer\"/><p class=\"foot__form-hint\" id=\"footer-newsletter-hint\">Advisories, teardowns and methodology notes. Roughly monthly. No sales sequence, one-click unsubscribe.</p></form></div></div><div class=\"foot__bottom\"><div class=\"foot__legal\"><p class=\"foot__legal-line\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Envenox Ltd<!-- -->. Registered in England and Wales. Registered office:<!-- --> <!-- -->1 Fore Street Avenue, London EC2Y 9DT<!-- -->.</p><ul class=\"foot__legal-nav\"><li><